12:41:33,614 --> 12:41:40,516
计数检查通过是让这道题变难的细节，而这个解释非常值得记住。
The count check passing is the detail that makes this question hard, and the explanation is worth carrying beyond it.

7650
12:41:41,294 --> 12:41:44,644
之前的比较是在任务输出和数据仓库之间进行的。
The comparison was between the job's output and the warehouse.

7651
12:41:45,582 --> 12:41:51,652
这两者都是连接操作的下游，因此被连接过滤掉的行在任何一侧都没有被计数。
Both of those are downstream of the join, so rows the join discarded were never counted on either side.

7652
12:41:51,888 --> 12:41:59,076
这就是为什么行数检查比看起来要弱得多，而将聚合结果与源系统进行对比则更强有力。
That is why a row count check is considerably weaker than it looks and why comparing an aggregate against the source system is stronger.

7653
