引用完整性是 DQDL 规则类型，准确命名了这种特定的失败情况。
Referential integrity is the DQDL rule type, naming this precise failure.

7654
12:42:06,208 --> 12:42:11,044
它断言列中的每个值都必须存在于参考数据集中。
It asserts that every value in a column exists in a reference data set.

7655
12:42:11,662 --> 12:42:14,948
它本可以捕捉到第一个不匹配的商户代码。
It would have caught the first unmatched merchant code.

