13:14:57,001 --> 13:15:07,940
提到聚合管道进一步收窄了要求，因为这些是 MongoDB 特有的查询结构，而不仅仅是简单的文档读取。
Amazon MSK The mention of aggregation pipelines tightens the requirement further because those are a MongoDB specific query construct rather than simple document reads.

