13:16:03,086 --> 13:16:04,996
A. 启用 S3。
a Enable S3.

8038
13:16:06,158 --> 13:16:10,244
智能分层，将不常访问的数据移动到更便宜的层级。
Intelligent tearings who infrequently access data moves to cheaper tiers.

8039
13:16:10,926 --> 13:16:11,168
B
B

8040
13:16:12,238 --> 13:16:16,132
启用跨区域复制并删除原始副本。
Enable cross-region replication and delete the primary copies.

8041
13:16:17,488 --> 13:16:21,412
C. 禁用版本控制，以停止旧版本的堆积。
C Disable versioning to stop old versions accumulating.

8042
13:16:22,608 --> 13:16:29,088
D. 添加生命周期规则，以清理非当前版本并避免不完整的多部分上传。
D Add lifecycle rules to expire non current versions and to avoid incomplete multi part uploads.

8043
13:16:29,806 --> 13:16:30,788
暂停并做出决定。
Pause and decide.

8044
13:16:40,560 --> 13:16:46,800
答案是 B，题目将场景中的每个细节都对应到了答案的其中一半上。
The answer is B, and the question maps each detail in the scenario onto one half of the answer.

8045
13:16:47,054 --> 13:16:53,280
每日覆盖与版本控制相结合，解释了非当前版本的堆积情况。
The nightly overwrite combined with versioning explains the accumulating non-current versions.

8046
13:16:54,382 --> 13:17:01,284
这是因为在开启了版本的存储桶中覆盖对象会保留之前的版本，并且你需要为此付费。
That is because overwriting an object on a version bucket retains the previous version indefinitely and you pay for it.

8047
13:17:03,790 --> 13:17:09,284
不可靠的链接和失败的大文件上传解释了不完整的多部分上传。
The unreliable link and the failed large uploads explains the incomplete multi-part parts

8048
13:17:09,966 --> 13:17:13,252
这些内容作为存储构建，但在列出桶内容时不会显示。
that are built as storage and do not appear when you list a bucket.

8049
13:17:14,126 --> 13:17:17,700
选项 C 是直觉上的反应，但它有两个错误。
Option C is the intuitive response and it is doubly wrong.

8050
13:17:18,414 --> 13:17:27,040
它保留了所有现有的版本，并且移除了一项团队在可能丢失某些内容后特意开启的保护措施。
It leaves every existing version in place and it removes the protection the team deliberately enabled after presumably losing something.

8051
13:17:28,334 --> 13:17:29,796
第 12 题。
Question 12 of 20.

8052
13:17:30,222 --> 13:17:31,172
领域 2。
Domain 2.

8053
13:17:31,662 --> 13:17:36,388
一个爬虫已将一组以管道符分隔的文本文件编目到 Amazon S3 中。
A crawler has catalogued a set of pipe delimited text files in Amazon S3.

8054
13:17:37,006 --> 13:17:41,220
分析师在查询 Amazon Athena 中的结果表时发现了一个问题。
Analysts querying the resulting table in Amazon Athena find a problem.

8055
13:17:41,680 --> 13:17:47,620
每一行都出现在名为 core 0 的单个列中，包含整行内容作为一个字符串。
Every row appears in a single column named core 0 containing the entire line as one string.

8056
13:17:48,558 --> 13:17:51,268
这些文件具有一致的结构，并带有标题行。
The files have a consistent structure with a header row.

8057
13:17:51,822 --> 13:17:53,412
数据工程师应该怎么做？
What should the data engineer do?

8058
13:17:54,350 --> 13:17:58,212
a. 增加爬虫的采样量，以便它读取更多文件。
a increase the crawler's sample size so it reads more files.

8059
13:17:58,990 --> 13:18:04,036
b. 创建一个定义管道符分隔符的自定义分类器并重新运行爬虫。
b. Create a custom classifier defining the pipe delimiter and rerun the crawler.

8060
13:18:04,718 --> 13:18:08,292
C. 将爬虫的架构变更策略设置为更新表。
C. Set the crawler schema change policy to update the table.

8061
13:18:09,040 --> 13:18:09,280
D。
D.

8062
13:18:10,640 --> 13:18:13,444
在爬取之前将文件转换为 Parquet 格式。
Convert the files to parquet before crawling them.

8063
13:18:13,774 --> 13:18:14,948
暂停并做出决定。
Pause and decide.

8064
13:18:24,494 --> 13:18:25,600
答案是 B。
The answer is B.

8065
13:18:25,840 --> 13:18:29,956
描述的症状非常典型，值得立即识别。
The symptom described is distinctive and worth recognizing instantly.

8066
13:18:30,240 --> 13:18:36,868
如果每一行都变成一个字符串列，意味着爬虫无法识别文件的结构。
A table where every row is a single string column means the crawler could not work out how the file is structured.

8067
13:18:37,454 --> 13:18:44,292
它退而求其次将每行视为一个值，这是在不识别格式时它能做的最安全的操作。
It fell back to treating each line as one value, which is the safest thing it can do when it does not recognize a format.

8068
13:18:44,782 --> 13:18:53,348
内置分类器涵盖了 CSV 和 JSON 等常见格式，而异常的分割符需要自定义分类器来定义模式。
Built-in classifiers cover common formats like CSV and JSON, and an unusual delimiter needs a custom classifier defining the pattern.

8069
13:18:54,254 --> 13:18:58,560
选项 D 有趣，因为转换为 Parquet 的确可以解决问题。
Option D is interesting because converting to parquet would indeed solve it.

8070
13:18:58,800 --> 13:19:04,420
但它需要先有东西来解析管道符分隔的文件，而这正是目前缺失的功能。
It requires something to parse the pipe delimited files first, which is the capability that is missing.

8071
13:19:05,934 --> 13:19:07,440
第 13 题，共 20 题。
Question 13 of 20.

8072
13:19:07,726 --> 13:19:15,844
领域 3。一个包含 5 年 Parquet 数据且按名为 event_date 的字符串列进行分区的 Athena 表。
Domain 3 An Athena table over 5 years of parquet data is partitioned by a string column named event underscore date.

8073
13:19:16,400 --> 13:19:23,268
分析师改用一个从 event_timestamp 列中提取日期的函数来进行过滤。结果是正确的。
Analysts filter with a function that extracts the date from an event underscore timestamp column instead. Results are correct.

8074
13:19:23,886 --> 13:19:29,380
但查询每次都会扫描整个表，Athena 的账单远高于预期。
Queries scan the entire table every time, and the Athena bill is far higher than expected.

8075
13:19:29,760 --> 13:19:30,916
原因是什么？
What is the cause?

8076
13:19:31,438 --> 13:19:34,500
a 该表需要一个 Glue 分区索引。
a The table needs a blue partition index.

8077
13:19:34,880 --> 13:19:38,468
b 工作组的数据扫描限制设置得太高了。
b The workgroup's data scan limit has been set too high.

8078
13:19:38,990 --> 13:19:43,588
c. 过滤条件应用于派生值，因此 Athena 无法裁剪分区。
C. The filter is applied to a derived value, so Athena cannot prune partitions.

8079
13:19:44,080 --> 13:19:44,400
d.
D.

8080
13:19:45,321 --> 13:19:48,420
Parquet 文件太小，需要进行合并。
Parquet files are too small and need compaction.

8081
13:19:49,486 --> 13:19:50,820
稍停一下，做决定。
Pause and decide.

8082
13:20:00,526 --> 13:20:05,123
答案是 B，这是 Athena 中最昂贵的隐性错误。
The answer is B, and this is the most expensive silent mistake available in Athena.

8083
13:20:05,742 --> 13:20:12,068
对时间戳列应用函数进行过滤在逻辑上是正确的，并且能产出完全正确的数据行。
Filtering on a function applied to a timestamp column is logically correct and produces exactly the right rows.

8084
13:20:12,400 --> 13:20:17,316
但引擎无法将该函数的输出与它获知的分区列关联起来。
The engine has no way to connect that function's output to the partition column it was told about.

8085
13:20:17,934 --> 13:20:23,040
所以它会读取每一个分区，丢弃掉几乎所有的内容，并向你收取这些没用的扫描费用。
So it reads every partition, discards almost all of it, and charges you for the not.

8086
13:20:23,440 --> 13:20:26,372
解决方法是直接在分区列上进行过滤。
The fix is to filter on the partition column directly.

8087
13:20:26,800 --> 13:20:32,900
这也是为什么模块 9 的隐藏分区很重要，因为 Iceberg 会记录转换本身。
This is also why module 9's hidden partitioning matters because iceberg records the transform itself.

8088
13:20:33,742 --> 13:20:38,884
这样分析师无需了解底层布局，直接在源列上过滤就能正确裁剪。
So a filter on the source column prunes correctly without the analyst knowing the layout.

8089
13:20:40,494 --> 13:20:41,956
