A bank runs blue jobs in private subnets.

8158
13:26:02,336 --> 13:26:06,016
合规性要求数据不得经过公共互联网。
Compliance requires that no data traverses the public internet.

8159
13:26:06,496 --> 13:26:13,284
这些任务只能访问指定的 3 个 Amazon S3 bucket，而不是 AWS 中的任何 bucket。
The jobs can reach only 3, named Amazon S3 buckets rather than any bucket in AWS.

8160
13:26:14,190 --> 13:26:23,268
子网目前通过 NAT 网关路由出站流量，并且作业通过公共端点连接到 Amazon S3。
The subnets currently route outbound traffic through a NIT gateway and jobs reach Amazon S3 over its public endpoint.

8161
13:26:24,142 --> 13:26:26,244
数据工程师应该实施什么？
What should the data engineer implement?

8162
13:26:27,214 --> 13:26:32,548
A. 在视图角色上设置一个 IAM 策略，仅允许访问那三个存储桶。
a an IAM policy on the view role permitting only those three buckets.

8163
13:26:34,414 --> 13:26:38,564
B. 在三个存储桶上分别设置存储桶策略，并保留 NAT gateway。
Bucket policies on each of the three buckets, keeping the NAT gateway.

8164
13:26:39,278 --> 13:26:43,204
C. 将 Glue 工作移动到公共子网以简化路由。
C. Move the glue jobs into public subnets to simplify routing.

8165
13:26:43,776 --> 13:26:44,096
D。
D.

8166
13:26:44,622 --> 13:26:51,296
D. 创建一个带有端点策略的 S3 网关端点，在策略中指定三个存储桶，并移除通过 NAT gateway 的 S3 路由。
An S3 gateway endpoint with an endpoint policy naming the three buckets and remove the S3 route through the NAT gateway.

8167
13:26:51,536 --> 13:26:52,612
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

8168
13:27:01,934 --> 13:27:03,056
答案是 A。
The answer is A.

8169
13:27:03,182 --> 13:27:06,916
而选项 C 是一个非常具有误导性的干扰项。
and option C is the instructive near MissWord study.

8170
13:27:10,222 --> 13:27:17,316
将 Glue 角色的权限限制在三个存储桶的 IAM 策略是真正的最小权限原则，且它管理的是身份。
An IAM policy limiting the blue role to three buckets is genuine least privilege and it governs the identity.

8171
13:27:17,856 --> 13:27:24,452
任何可以编辑该角色的人都可以扩大权限，而且无论如何，流量仍会经过公共互联网路径。
Anyone who can edit that role can widen it, and the traffic still travels the public internet path regardless.

8172
13:27:25,296 --> 13:27:31,856
端点策略决定了无论哪个身份在请求，通过网络路径究竟能访问到什么。
An endpoint policy governs what can be reached through a network path at all, whichever identity is asking.

8173
13:27:32,096 --> 13:27:34,148
这就是数据边界的含义。
That is what a data perimeter means.

8174
13:27:34,416 --> 13:27:42,404
当合规性要求说明“工作只能访问三个命名的存储桶，而不是 AWS 中的任何存储桶”时，它描述的就是这个要求。
It is what the compliance requirement is describing when it says jobs may reach only three name buckets, rather than any bucket in AWS.

8175
13:27:44,078 --> 13:27:45,536
第 18 题，共 20 题。
Question 18 of 20.

8176
13:27:45,776 --> 13:27:46,660
领域 4。
Domain 4.

8177
13:27:48,654 --> 13:27:56,416
一家公司配置了 AWS Lake Formation 的列级授权，旨在从分析团队中排除三个敏感列。
A company has configured AWS Lake Formation column level grants excluding three sensitive columns from an analytics

8178
13:27:56,656 --> 13:27:57,136
（题目延续）
team.

8179
13:27:57,614 --> 13:28:00,740
这些授权在 Lake Formation 控制台中显示正常。
The grants appear correctly in the lake formation console.

8180
13:28:01,678 --> 13:28:06,020
测试显示，分析团队仍能通过 Amazon Athena 查询所有列。
Testing shows the analytics team can still query all columns through Amazon Athena.

8181
13:28:06,496 --> 13:28:09,636
该数据库是在采用 Lake Formation 之前创建的。
The database was created before lake formation was adopted.

8182
13:28:09,936 --> 13:28:11,844
最可能的原因是什么？
What is the most likely cause?

8183
13:28:12,270 --> 13:28:17,572
a. 列级授权仅适用于 Amazon Redshift Spectrum，不适用于 Athena。
a column level grants only apply to Amazon Redshift Spectrum, not to Athena.

8184
13:28:18,256 --> 13:28:18,576
b
b

8185
13:28:19,694 --> 13:28:25,956
IAM Allowed Principles 设置仍然存在，因此 Lake Formation 对该资源的控制与 IAM 不同。
The IAM Allowed Principles Setting is still present, so Lake Formation differs to IAMC.

8186
13:28:27,534 --> 13:28:30,244
c. 授权需要长达 24 小时才能生效。
The grants need up to 24 hours to propagate.

8187
13:28:30,576 --> 13:28:35,428
d. 表必须转换为 Apache Iceberg，列级授权才会生效。
D. The table must be converted to Apache Iceberg for column grants to apply.

8188
13:28:35,982 --> 13:28:37,188
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide

8189
13:28:46,894 --> 13:28:53,348
答案是 B，关于数据库在 Lake Formation 之前创建的句子就是揭示真相的关键线索。
The answer is B, and the sentence about the database predating lake formation is the clue that gives it away.

8190
13:28:54,478 --> 13:29:03,648
当数据库或表带有 IAM Allowed Principles 设置时，Lake Formation 对该资源的控制将完全遵循 IAM。
When a database or table carries the IAM Allowed Principles setting, lake formation differs to IAM entirely for that resource.

8191
13:29:04,174 --> 13:29:12,260
这样你就可以创建精确的列级授权，在控制台中正确查看到它们，并观察到每个人仍然可以看到所有列。
So you can create precise column level grants, see them listed correctly in the console, and observe that everybody still sees every column.

8192
13:29:12,846 --> 13:29:17,796
任何地方都不会报错，而这恰恰是导致诊断变得如此令人困惑的原因。
Nothing errors anywhere, which is exactly what makes it so confusing to diagnose.

8193
13:29:18,638 --> 13:29:25,508
移除该设置会激活强制执行，而混合访问模式对于现有的数据湖来说是更安全的路径。
Removing that setting is what activates enforcement and hybrid access mode is the safer path for an existing lake.

8194
13:29:26,318 --> 13:29:29,924
这是因为它允许你一次一个地移动主体。
That is because it lets you move principles across one at a time.

8195
13:29:31,568 --> 13:29:33,444
第 19 题，共 20 题。
Question 19 of 20.

8196
13:29:33,774 --> 13:29:34,820
领域 4。
Domain 4.

8197
13:29:35,408 --> 13:29:41,348
一家公司在 9 个月前在其数据湖中启用了 Amazon Macie。
A company enabled Amazon Messi across its data lake 9 months ago.

8198
13:29:41,888 --> 13:29:51,428
该数据湖包含分布在 300 个 S3 bucket 中的 60TB 数据，所有数据都使用多个客户托管密钥通过 SSE-KMS 进行加密。
The lake holds 60TB across 300 buckets, all encrypted with SSEKMS using several customer managed keys.

8199
13:29:51,888 --> 13:29:55,236
Macie 报告的敏感数据发现几乎为零。
Macy reports almost no sensitive data findings.

8200
13:29:56,142 --> 13:30:00,836
对两个数据集的手动审查发现了未脱敏的电子邮件地址和支付卡号码。
A manual review of two datasets has found unredacted email addresses and payment card numbers.

8201
13:30:01,088 --> 13:30:02,980
最可能的解释是什么？
What is the most likely explanation?

8202
13:30:03,534 --> 13:30:09,252
a. Macie 没有使用 KMS 密钥的权限，因此它只能报告对象元数据。
a Macy lacks permission to use the KMS keys so it can only report object metadata.

8203
13:30:09,728 --> 13:30:09,968
b。
b.

8204
13:30:10,638 --> 13:30:14,596
b. Macie 在没有自定义数据标识符的情况下无法检测到支付卡号码。
Macy does not detect payment card numbers without a custom data identifier.

8205
13:30:15,374 --> 13:30:15,648
c。
C.

8206
13:30:16,398 --> 13:30:19,460
c. Macie 只采样每个对象的第一个兆字节。
Macy samples only the first megabyte of each object.

8207
13:30:19,982 --> 13:30:24,356
d. 结果已过期，因为 Macie 只保留 90 天的结果。
D. The findings expired because Macy retains results for 90 days.

8208
13:30:24,688 --> 13:30:25,796
思考一下并做出决定。
Pause and decide.

8209
13:30:39,568 --> 13:30:48,676
一个报告为空的安全工具有两种可能的解释。一种让人放心的解释是确实没有什么可报告的；另一种是它看不见。
A security tool reporting nothing has two possible explanations. And the comfortable one is that there is nothing to report. The other is that it cannot see.

8210
13:30:49,166 --> 13:30:55,248
在已知包含客户数据的 300 个 bucket 中，持续九个月几乎没有任何动静，属于后者。
Nine months of near silence across 300 buckets known to hold customer data is the second.

8211
13:30:55,648 --> 13:30:58,436
题目中的加密细节就是线索。
The encryption detail in the question is the clue.

8212
13:30:58,928 --> 13:31:06,756
Macie 需要在密钥策略中获得权限才能解密它检查的对象，如果没有该权限，它只能报告对象元数据。
Messi needs to be permitted in the key policy to decrypt objects it inspects, and without that it reports object metadata only.

8213
13:31:07,568 --> 13:31:12,804
AWS 发布了一个脚本来列出所需的密钥。
AWS publishes a script to enumerate which keys needed.

8214
13:31:14,286 --> 13:31:15,808
第 20 题，共 20 题。
Question 20 of 20.

8215
13:31:15,982 --> 13:31:16,932
领域 4。
Domain 4.

8216
13:31:17,710 --> 13:31:24,036
一家市场研究公司想向大约 150 名外部客户销售三个精选的数据集。
A market research firm wants to sell three curated datasets to around 150 external customers.

8217
13:31:24,448 --> 13:31:30,884
订阅者应自动收到季度更新，并且当订阅到期时访问权限必须终止。
Subscribers should receive quarterly revisions automatically and access must end when a subscription lapses.

8218
13:31:31,726 --> 13:31:35,408
该公司不想建立授权管理或计费系统。
The firm does not want to build entitlement management or billing.

8219
13:31:35,648 --> 13:31:42,052
一个提议是为每个客户创建一个 S3 bucket，并在每次更新后将数据集复制到每个 bucket 中。
A proposal is to create an S3 bucket per customer and copy the datasets into each after every revision.

8220
13:31:42,368 --> 13:31:44,868
数据工程师应该推荐什么替代方案？
What should the data engineer recommend instead?

8221
13:31:46,798 --> 13:31:51,428
使用一个包含所有 150 个账户列表的存储桶策略的单一存储桶。
A single bucket with a bucket policy listing all 150 accounts.

8222
13:31:52,528 --> 13:31:55,940
使用计划的 Glue 作业来自动执行每个客户的数据复制。
Automate the per customer copying with a scheduled blue job.

8223
13:31:56,622 --> 13:31:56,848
C。
C.

8224
13:31:57,262 --> 13:32:01,476
授予到每个客户账户的 AWS Lake Formation 跨账户权限。
AWS Lake Formation cross account grants to each customer account.

8225
13:32:02,368 --> 13:32:08,612
D. 通过具有管理权限和修订版本的 AWS Data Exchange 发布数据集。
D. AWS Data Exchange Publishing the Datasets with Managed entitlements and Revisions.

8226
13:32:20,142 --> 13:32:22,176
答案是 A。
The answer is A.

8227
13:32:23,118 --> 13:32:29,216
该要求列出了将外部商业共享与普通跨账户访问区分开来的三件事。
The requirement names the three things that distinguish external commercial sharing from ordinary cross account access.

8228
13:32:29,806 --> 13:32:35,172
订阅者、自动修订，以及在订阅到期时终止的访问权限。
Subscribers, automatic revisions, and access ending when a subscription lapses.

8229
13:32:35,950 --> 13:32:42,532
选项 C 值得尊重，因为 Lake Formation 跨账户授权确实能提供访问部分。
Option C deserves respect because Lake Formation cross account grants genuinely would deliver the access part.

8230
13:32:42,990 --> 13:32:49,444
他们让公司去构建它明确表示不想构建的权限和计费机制。
They leave the firm building exactly the entitlement and billing machinery it explicitly said it did not want to build.

8231
13:32:50,222 --> 13:32:58,884
选项 D 是自动化陷阱，即自动化一个糟糕的设计只会让执行变快，而不会让它变得更好。
Option D is the automation trap, where automating a poor design makes it faster to execute without making it any better.

8232
13:33:00,366 --> 13:33:09,536
150 个副本仍会产生偏差、产生存储成本，并且在有人停止付费时仍需逐一撤销。
150 copies still drift apart, still cost storage, and still have to be revoked individually when somebody stops paying.

8233
13:33:10,926 --> 13:33:15,588
特别强调的内容是保留两组结果而非仅保留第二组的原因。
The call-out is the reason to keep both sets of results rather than only the second.

8234
13:33:16,110 --> 13:33:21,060
你在考试 1 中漏掉但在这次通过的一行，可能是第一次时的阅读疏忽。
A row you missed in exam 1 and passed here was probably a reading slip the first time.

8235
13:33:21,678 --> 13:33:27,204
如果你在两次考试中都漏掉的某一行，就是知识点的真实漏洞，对应的模块就是你应该去查漏补缺的地方。
A row you missed in both is a real gap in the material, and the module named is where to go.

8236
13:33:28,174 --> 13:33:35,524
两场每题 20 道的考试只是一个小样本。因此，把单次失误视为干扰项，将重复出现的错误视为信号。
Two exams of 20 questions each is a small sample. So treat a single miss as noise and a repeated one as signal.

8237
13:33:36,110 --> 13:33:39,780
这种区分比任何单一的分数都更有用。
That distinction is more useful than either score on its own.

8238
13:33:40,096 --> 13:33:44,612
这也是这些考试在相同领域内涵盖不同内容的原因。
And it is the reason these exams cover different ground within the same domains.

8239
13:33:46,190 --> 13:33:52,656
特别强调的内容指出了值得刻意寻找的模式，因为它不需要权衡各种选择就能解决问题。
The callout names the pattern worth hunting for deliberately because it resolves without any weighing of alternatives.

8240
13:33:52,896 --> 13:33:56,004
Lambda 的超时时间不能超过 15 分钟。
Lambda's timeout cannot be raised past 15 minutes.

8241
13:33:56,334 --> 13:34:00,772
Lake Formation 确实适用于 Athena。Macie 可以检测到支付卡号。
Lake formation does apply to Athena. Macy does detect payment card numbers.

8242
13:34:01,358 --> 13:34:04,256
即使增加样本量的爬虫也无法识别出分隔符。
A crawler with more samples still cannot pass a delimiter.

8243
13:34:04,496 --> 13:34:05,700
它无法识别。
It does not recognize.

8244
13:34:06,256 --> 13:34:12,132
每一个这样的点都是基于事实而非判断来排除选项，这只需要几秒钟且没有风险。
Each of those eliminates an option on a fact rather than a judgment, which takes seconds and carries no risk.

8245
13:34:12,656 --> 13:34:17,856
发现一个不可能的选项能将盲猜的概率从 25% 提高到 33%。
Spotting one impossible option improves a blind guess from 25% to 33%.

8246
13:34:18,510 --> 13:34:20,516
这是在你进行任何真正思考之前就做到的。
That is before you have done any real thinking.

8247
13:34:21,998 --> 13:34:29,444
特别强调的内容指出了导致超时最可能的原因，即在阅读约束条件前先看选项，然后陷入自我纠结。
The callout points at the most likely cause of running over, which is reading the options before the constraint and then arguing with yourself.

8248
13:34:30,016 --> 13:34:35,376
先读问题，再读场景，然后寻找那些排除掉某些可能性的句子。
Read the question first, then the scenario, then hunt for the sentence that refuses something.

8249
13:34:35,918 --> 13:34:39,428
当你看到选项时，已经知道哪些是不可能的了。
You arrive at the options already knowing what cannot be true.

8250
13:34:40,110 --> 13:34:43,716
这比权衡四个看似合理的方案更快、也更准确。
That is faster and more accurate than weighing four plausible designs.

8251
13:34:44,430 --> 13:34:49,796
最后一项也值得认真对待，因为顺利完成就是一种信息。
The last bullet is worth taking seriously as well, because finishing comfortably is information.

8252
13:34:50,736 --> 13:34:56,740
这意味着你可以花点时间去处理那两三个真正需要细看的题目。
It means you can afford to slow down on the two or three questions that genuinely deserve it.

8253
13:34:58,190 --> 13:35:00,256
第四项是大家经常忽略的一项。
The fourth bullet is the one people skip.

8254
13:35:00,782 --> 13:35:09,828
在没复盘的情况下，做完第二套题紧接着做第三套，只是对同一知识点的第三次测量，而不是进步。
Taking a third practice exam immediately after a second, with no review in between, produces a third measurement of the same knowledge, not an improvement.

8255
13:35:10,670 --> 13:35:18,244
复盘才是学习发生的环节，这就是为什么这些考试中的每个选项都有其背后的原因，而不只是一个分数。
The review is where the learning happens, which is why every option in these exams carries a reason rather than just a mark.

8256
13:35:20,430 --> 13:35:25,732
接下来是练习题 3，最后会回顾全部 60 道题的趋势。
Practice exam 3 follows and it closes with a look at the trend across all 60 questions.

8257
13:35:26,638 --> 13:35:32,036
这比任何单一的分数都更有信息量，因为它能显示出复盘是否奏效。
That is more informative than any single score because it shows whether the reviewing is working.

8258
13:35:33,550 --> 13:35:42,576
最后一个模块包含另外 20 道实战题，前两组都没涵盖到，权重相同，其中包含两个多选式回答问题。
The final module, 20 more questions on ground, neither of the earlier sets covered, weighted the same way with two multiple response questions among them.

8259
13:35:42,736 --> 13:35:46,176
之后，这个模块做了一些其他两个没做的事情。
Afterwards, this module does something the other two did not.

8260
13:35:46,894 --> 13:35:52,452
那就是查看全部 60 道题的趋势，而不是看单一的分数。
That is to look at the trend across all 60 questions rather than at a single score.

8261
13:35:53,934 --> 13:36:02,096
这种趋势比任何单一结果都有信息量，因为它能告诉你，在尝试之间进行复盘是否真的改变了什么。
That trend is more informative than any one result because it tells you whether reviewing between attempts is actually changing anything.

8262
13:36:02,894 --> 13:36:05,252
然后是课程的简短结尾。
Then a short close to the course.

8263
13:36:05,696 --> 13:36:10,212
如果你已经完成了全部 26 个模块，这就是大约 10 小时的最后部分。
If you have worked through all 26 modules, this is the last of about 10 hours.

8264
13:36:11,694 --> 13:36:14,564
这个提示值得采取行动，而不是直接跳过。
The callout is worth acting on rather than reading past.

8265
13:36:16,398 --> 13:36:22,564
如果你刚做完考试 2 并准备立即开始这一项，请停下来先复习你做错的题目。
If you have just finished exam 2 and are starting this immediately, stop and review the questions you got wrong first.

8266
13:36:23,406 --> 13:36:29,860
因为否则这套题会发现同样的漏洞，而你会浪费 40 分钟去确认那些你已经知道的内容。
That is because otherwise this set will find the same gaps and you will have spent 40 minutes confirming what you already knew.

8267
13:36:30,190 --> 13:36:37,668
20 道题是一个很小的样本，3 组每组 20 道题仍然是个小样本。所以有用的信号不是分数。
20 questions is a small sample, and 3 sets of 20 is still a small sample. So the useful signal is not the score.

8268
13:36:38,158 --> 13:36:46,148
而是你在第一场考试后识别出的某类错误，到第三场考试时是否不再出现。
It is whether a category of mistake you identified after exam one has stopped appearing by exam 3.

8269
13:36:47,918 --> 13:36:52,356
第四项是你在做这套题时值得了解的设计选择。
The fourth bullet is the design choice worth knowing about as you work through this set.

8270
13:36:52,974 --> 13:36:57,540
因为这是这些模拟考试最接近真实考试逻辑的地方。
That is because it is the closest these exams come to reproducing what the real one does.

8271
13:36:58,350 --> 13:37:05,540
第一场考试中的一个分区问题，分析师从不按小时过滤。所以移除小时分区是正确的。
A partition question in exam one had analysts who never filtered by hour. So removing the hour partition was correct.

8272
13:37:06,032 --> 13:37:07,152
