数据工程师应该选择什么？
What should the data engineer use?

8404
13:48:26,382 --> 13:48:30,308
A. 由文件到达触发的 AWS Lambda 函数。
a An AWS Lambda function triggered by the file arrival.

8405
13:48:31,040 --> 13:48:31,280
B。
B.

8406
13:48:31,886 --> 13:48:35,760
保留 Glue Spark 作业，并将其缩减到最小的 2 DPU 使用量。
Keep the Glue Spark job and reduce it to the minimum 2 dB use.

8407
13:48:36,320 --> 13:48:36,560
C。
C.

8408
13:48:37,038 --> 13:48:38,564
一个 Glue Python shell 作业。
A Glue Python shell job.

8409
13:48:39,342 --> 13:48:39,600
D。
D.

8410
13:48:40,078 --> 13:48:43,108
一个 Amazon EMR 无服务器 应用程序。
An Amazon EMR serverless application.

8411
13:48:44,334 --> 13:48:45,508
停下来做决定。
Pause and decide.

8412
13:48:55,022 --> 13:49:01,060
答案是 B。选项 C 是值得研究的干扰项，因为它非常接近正确答案。
The answer is B. And option C is the distractor worth studying because it is nearly right.

8413
13:49:01,806 --> 13:49:10,400
对于非分布式任务，使用 Glue Python shell 作业是正确的直觉，因为它能避开 Spark 且成本明显更低。
A blue Python shell job is the correct instinct moving away from Spark for work that is not distributed and it is meaningfully cheaper.

8414
13:49:10,926 --> 13:49:17,440
它仍包含 Glue 的启动时间，且其一分钟的计费最小限制每天会产生 24 次费用。
It still carries blue startup time and its one minute billing minimum incurred 24 times a

8415
13:49:17,440 --> 13:49:22,084
Lambda 函数处理此文件的时间不到一秒。
day. A Lambda function processes this file in well under a second.

8416
13:49:22,960 --> 13:49:30,564
“其中大部分是启动时间”这一短语是决定性的细节，因为它告诉你引擎的开销超过了实际工作量。
The phrase, most of which is startup is the deciding detail because it tells you the engine's overhead exceeds the actual work.

8417
13:49:31,438 --> 13:49:35,748
这意味着该引擎属于错误类别，而不是配置不当。
That means the engine is the wrong category rather than badly configured.

8418
13:49:37,390 --> 13:49:39,076
第 8 题，共 20 题。
Question 8 of 20.

8419
13:49:39,502 --> 13:49:40,324
领域 2。
Domain 2.

8420
13:49:40,814 --> 13:49:45,920
一家公司正在推出新产品，并将遥测数据存储在 Amazon S3 中。
A company is launching a new product and will store its telemetry in Amazon S3.

8421
13:49:46,382 --> 13:49:53,188
没人能预测数据的读取频率，且随着产品的成熟，访问模式预计会发生变化。
Nobody can predict how often the data will be read, and access patterns are expected to change as the product matures.

8422
13:49:54,350 --> 13:49:56,160
对象平均大小为 4 MB。
Objects average 4 MB.

8423
13:49:57,280 --> 13:50:02,273
团队希望在不因错误预测而产生检索费用的情况下，最大限度地降低存储成本。
The team wants to minimize storage cost without risking retrieval charges from a wrong guess.

8424
13:50:02,720 --> 13:50:04,772
数据工程师应该如何配置？
What should the data engineer configure?

8425
13:50:05,294 --> 13:50:08,068
A. 一个转到标准存储的生命周期规则。
a a lifecycle rule transitioning to standard.

8426
13:50:08,480 --> 13:50:10,372
在 30 天后执行。
I A after 30 days.

8427
13:50:10,734 --> 13:50:13,540
B. S3 Intelligent-Tiering。
B S3 Intelligent Tiering.

8428
13:50:14,254 --> 13:50:14,480
C
C

8429
13:50:15,470 --> 13:50:18,372
A 个转到 Glacier Instant 的生命周期规则。
A life cycle rule transitioning to glacier instant.

8430
13:50:18,574 --> 13:50:20,132
在 7 天后检索。
Retrieval after 7 days.

8431
13:50:21,200 --> 13:50:21,520
D
D

8432
13:50:22,286 --> 13:50:23,396
S3 区域。
S31 zone.

8433
13:50:23,886 --> 13:50:25,760
从一开始就是不常用的访问。
Infrequent access from the outset.

8434
13:50:26,000 --> 13:50:27,236
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

8435
13:50:36,942 --> 13:50:38,020
答案是 B。
The answer is B.

8436
13:50:38,574 --> 13:50:48,420
第 8 模块已经说明了，智能分层的触发词在不同题目中非常一致，而这个场景在一个段落里就用了两种形式的这种词。
Module 8 established that the trigger phrase for intelligent tiering is remarkably consistent across questions, and this scenario uses two forms of it in one paragraph.

8437
13:50:48,880 --> 13:50:53,700
访问模式无法预测，而且随着产品的成熟，这些模式预计会发生变化。
Access patterns cannot be predicted and they are expected to change as the product matures.

8438
13:50:54,606 --> 13:50:59,428
每一个生命周期规则都是在对未来的访问行为进行猜测。
Every lifecycle rule encodes a guess about how access will behave over time.

8439
13:51:00,238 --> 13:51:07,396
当没人能可靠地做出这种预测时，那种能够观察实际访问并相应移动对象的类别就是正确答案。
When nobody can make that guess reliably, the class that observes actual access and moves objects accordingly is the right answer.

8440
13:51:08,270 --> 13:51:17,188
4 MB 的对象大小也很重要，因为监控费用会让智能分层在处理极小对象时性价比不高。
The 4 MB object size matters too because the monitoring charge makes intelligent tiering poor value for very small objects.

8441
13:51:18,862 --> 13:51:20,836
第 9 题，共 20 题。
Question 9 of 20.

8442
13:51:21,296 --> 13:51:22,212
领域 2
Domain 2

8443
13:51:23,470 --> 13:51:30,532
一个每晚运行的流水线将订单记录加载到 Amazon Redshift 表中，该表在 order ID 上声明了主键。
A nightly pipeline loads order records into an Amazon Redshift table that has a declared primary key on order.

8444
13:51:31,502 --> 13:51:39,972
在上周发生故障并重新运行后，表中现在包含约 12,000 条重复的订单，导致报告数据虚高。
ID, after a failure and rerun last week, the table now contains around 12,000 duplicated orders and reports are overstated.

8445
13:51:40,878 --> 13:51:45,188
工程师感到很惊讶，因为主键应该会拒绝这些重复项。
The engineer is surprised because the primary key should have rejected them.

8446
13:51:46,030 --> 13:51:48,996
原因是什么？该实施什么方案？
What is the cause and what should be implemented?

8447
13:51:49,616 --> 13:51:54,628
a. 重新运行时使用了不同的分布键，导致产生了重复的分片。
a. The rerun used a different distribution key, creating duplicate slices.

8448
13:51:55,502 --> 13:52:02,096
b. 主键是在表创建后声明的。所以它只适用于新行。
b The primary key was declared after the table was created. So it applies only to new rows.

8449
13:52:03,342 --> 13:52:09,776
c. Redshift 的约束条件仅供信息参考，并不强制执行。使用暂存表和合并语句让加载过程具有幂等性。
Redshift constraints are informational and not enforced. Make the load idempotent with a staging table and a merge statement.

8450
13:52:10,016 --> 13:52:14,340
d. 启用自动表优化，让 Redshift 强制执行键。
D. Enable automatic table optimization so redshift enforces the key.

8451
13:52:14,798 --> 13:52:15,844
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

8452
13:52:25,422 --> 13:52:30,916
答案是 C，这个问题很容易误导那些来自关系型数据库背景的考生。
The answer is A, and this one catches people arriving from transactional databases.

8453
13:52:33,550 --> 13:52:38,692
Redshift 中的主键、外键和唯一性约束仅作为信息参考。
Primary key, foreign key, and uniqueness constraints in Redshift are informational only.

8454
13:52:39,726 --> 13:52:44,964
它们告诉查询规划器这些值是唯一的，这确实能帮助它选择更好的执行计划。
They tell the query planner that values are unique, which genuinely helps it choose better plans.

8455
13:52:45,806 --> 13:52:49,136
但它们并不会阻止你插入两次相同的行。
They do not prevent you inserting the same row twice.

8456
13:52:49,390 --> 13:52:58,692
只有“非空”约束是真正强制执行的。因此，一个依赖于键来拒绝已加载行的流水线，在重新运行后只会再次把这些行加载进去。
Only not null is actually enforced. So a pipeline relying on the key to reject rows it has already loaded will simply load them again after a rerun.

8457
13:52:59,056 --> 13:53:01,028
任何地方都没有报错提示问题。
Nothing anywhere reports a problem.

8458
13:53:01,838 --> 13:53:09,796
修复方法是让加载过程具有幂等性，这在 Redshift 中意味着复制到暂存表并执行合并操作。
The fix is to make the load idem potent, which in Redshift means copying to a staging table and applying a merge.

8459
13:53:11,470 --> 13:53:13,060
第 10 题，共 20 题。
Question 10 of 20.

8460
13:53:13,646 --> 13:53:14,564
领域 2。
Domain 2.

8461
13:53:14,736 --> 13:53:18,496
一个交易平台需要一个容量约为 200GB 的会话存储。
A trading platform needs a session store holding around 200GB.

8462
13:53:19,406 --> 13:53:26,724
读写操作必须在微秒内完成，且数据在可用区故障时不能丢失。
Reads and writes must complete in microseconds and the data must survive an availability zone failure without loss.

8463
13:53:27,534 --> 13:53:31,684
这是因为它是正在进行的会话的权威记录。
That is because it is the authoritative record for in-flight sessions.

8464
13:53:31,936 --> 13:53:39,012
团队目前使用一个由关系型数据库支持的内存缓存。数据工程师应该推荐什么？
The team currently uses an in-memory cache backed by a relational database. What should the data engineer recommend?

8465
13:53:39,502 --> 13:53:46,393
A. 带有 DynamoDB Accelerator 的 Amazon Dynamo DB，B. S3 Express One Zone。
a Amazon Dynamo DB with Dynamo DB Accelerator, B Amazon S3 Express One Zone.

8466
13:53:47,182 --> 13:53:47,456
C
C

8467
13:53:48,558 --> 13:53:52,676
C. 具有大缓冲区缓存的 Amazon Aurora PostgreSQL。
Amazon Aurora PostgreSQL with a large buffer cache.

8468
13:53:53,390 --> 13:53:55,908
D. Amazon MemoryDB。
D Amazon Memory DB.

8469
13:53:56,430 --> 13:53:57,764
停下来做决定。
Pause and decide.

8470
13:54:07,470 --> 13:54:13,572
答案是 B，这个问题是围绕缓存与持久性内存存储之间的区别构建的。
The answer is B and the question is built around the distinction between a cache and a durable in-memory store.

8471
13:54:14,478 --> 13:54:18,896
缓存保存的是存在于其他权威位置的数据副本。
A cache holds a copy of data that also lives somewhere authoritative.

8472
13:54:19,056 --> 13:54:22,020
因此丢失它只会影响性能，而不会导致数据丢失。
So losing it costs performance rather than data.

8473
13:54:22,958 --> 13:54:33,092
MemoryDB 是内存中的且具有持久性，并带有跨可用区的事务日志复制，这使其成为需要微秒级访问的数据的主要存储。
MemoryDB is in memory and durable with a transaction log replicated across availability zones, which lets it be the primary store for data needing microsecond access.

8474
13:54:34,158 --> 13:54:40,292
还要注意，MemoryDB 出现在本次考试的范围服务列表中，而 ElastiCache 没有。
Note also that MemoryDB appears on this exams in Scope Service List while ElastiCache does not.

8475
13:54:41,390 --> 13:54:47,460
这是 AWS 在此类问题中期望你选择哪一个服务的明确信号。
That is a fairly direct signal about which one AWS expects you to reach for in a question like this.

8476
13:54:48,974 --> 13:54:50,628
第 11 题，共 20 题。
Question 11 of 20.

8477
13:54:53,070 --> 13:54:53,956
领域 2。
Domain 2.

8478
13:54:54,478 --> 13:55:03,140
由于业务术语发生了变化，分析团队必须重命名 Amazon S3 中一个包含 Parquet 文件、跨度为 5 年的数据集中的列。
An analytics team must rename a column in a 5-year-old dataset of parquet files in Amazon S3 because the business term has changed.

8479
13:55:03,982 --> 13:55:10,436
历史查询必须继续返回相同的行，且重新编写 5 年的文件是不可接受的。
Historical queries must continue to return the same rows and rewriting 5 years of files is not acceptable.

8480
13:55:11,278 --> 13:55:14,896
该表由 Amazon Athena 和 Amazon EMR 查询。
The table is queried by Amazon Athena and Amazon EMR.

8481
13:55:15,136 --> 13:55:16,868
数据工程师应该怎么做？
What should the data engineer do?

8482
13:55:17,376 --> 13:55:22,596
a. 在 Glue 数据目录中重命名列，保持文件不变。
a rename the column in the blue data catalog and leave the files unchanged.

8483
13:55:23,342 --> 13:55:27,940
b. 创建一个视图，将旧列名别名为新名称。
b Create a view that aliases the old column name to the new one.

8484
13:55:28,576 --> 13:55:28,816
C。
C.

8485
13:55:29,518 --> 13:55:33,924
c. 将数据集转换为 Apache Iceberg，然后重命名列。
Convert the dataset to Apache Iceberg, then rename the column.

8486
13:55:34,414 --> 13:55:39,268
d. 用新的列名重写所有 5 年的 Parquet 文件。
d Rewrite all 5 years of parquet files with the new column name.

8487
13:55:39,918 --> 13:55:40,996
停下来做决定。
Pause and decide.

8488
13:55:50,702 --> 13:55:51,812
答案是 B。
The answer is B.

8489
13:55:52,174 --> 13:55:56,676
模块 9 涵盖了这一机制，这个问题直接测试了它。
Module 9 covered the mechanism and this question tests it directly.

8490
13:55:57,422 --> 13:56:01,892
在像原生 Parquet 这种基于名称的格式中，列是按名称匹配的。
In a name-based format like plain parquet, columns are matched by name.

8491
13:56:02,382 --> 13:56:10,532
因此，在重命名之前写入的文件和之后写入的文件看起来包含完全不同的列，而旧文件读取时会显示为空。
So a file written before a rename and one written after appear to contain different columns entirely, and the older files would read as null.

8492
13:56:10,976 --> 13:56:18,404
Iceberg 在创建每个列时都会分配一个稳定的数字标识符，并单独跟踪显示名称。
Iceberg assigns each column a stable numeric identifier when it is created and tracks the display name separately.

8493
13:56:19,310 --> 13:56:25,252
所以重命名只是改变了它的称呼，而所有历史文件都能正确映射。
So a rename changes what you call it while every historical file continues to map correctly.

8494
13:56:27,374 --> 13:56:35,172
选项 C 值得考虑，因为视图是一个合理的变通方案，而且它保留了底层的逻辑一致性。
Option C is worth respecting because a view is a legitimate workaround and it leaves the underlying inconsistency in place.

8495
13:56:36,590 --> 13:56:37,956
第 12 题，共 20 题。
Question 12 of 20.

8496
13:56:38,446 --> 13:56:39,268
领域 2。
Domain 2.

8497
13:56:39,776 --> 13:56:47,524
一个在 Glue 数据目录中的表，在经过 4 年的按小时分区后，大约有 14 万个分区。
A table in the AWS Blue Data Catalog has around 140,000 partitions after 4 years of hourly partitioning.

8498
13:56:48,096 --> 13:56:54,692
无论过滤条件多么精确，Athena 查询在开始扫描前都要花费 15 到 25 秒。
Ethina queries take 15 to 25 seconds before scanning begins, regardless of how narrow the filter is.

8499
13:56:55,502 --> 13:56:57,892
一旦开始扫描，它们就会很快完成。
Once scanning starts, they complete quickly.

8500
13:56:58,446 --> 13:57:01,572
分析师按日期范围过滤，偶尔按小时过滤。
Analysts filter by date range and occasionally by hour.

8501
13:57:02,222 --> 13:57:06,263
哪项操作能在保留小时粒度的同时解决延迟问题？
Which action addresses the delay while preserving the hourly granularity?

8502
13:57:07,022 --> 13:57:08,708
分析师偶尔使用？
analysts occasionally use?

8503
13:57:09,422 --> 13:57:14,596
A。按天重分区数据并丢弃小时分区。
a Repartition the data by day and discard the hour partition.

8504
13:57:16,496 --> 13:57:16,816
B
B

8505
13:57:18,094 --> 13:57:21,220
在分区键上添加 Glue 分区索引。
Add a GUE partition index on the partition keys.

8506
13:57:21,710 --> 13:57:22,016
C。
C.

8507
13:57:22,496 --> 13:57:25,136
增加 Athena 工作组的查询超时时间。
Increase the Athena work group's query timeout.

8508
13:57:25,806 --> 13:57:26,096
D。
D.

8509
13:57:26,542 --> 13:57:30,692
运行 MSCK repair table 来刷新分区元数据。
Run MS CK repair table to refresh the partition metadata.

8510
13:57:31,406 --> 13:57:32,548
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

8511
13:57:42,256 --> 13:57:49,028
答案是 A，这个问题是故意设计成与模拟考试中一个类似问题的镜像题。
The answer is A, and this question is deliberately the mirror image of a similar one in practice exam.

8512
13:57:50,638 --> 13:57:59,108
1. 在那道题里，分析师从不按小时查询，所以移除小时分区是正确的修复方案，因为它直接解决了成本问题。
1. There, analysts never queried by hour, so removing the hour partition was the correct fix because it addressed the cost directly.

8513
13:58:00,014 --> 13:58:08,964
而这里题目说明分析师偶尔会按小时过滤，这使得合并分区变成了一种功能损失，而不是完美的赢。
Here the question states that analysts occasionally do filter by hour, which makes courseing the partitions a loss of capability rather than a clean win.

8514
13:58:09,838 --> 13:58:18,852
当确实需要分区方案时，分区索引是正确的答案，它在不改变布局的情况下加快了目录查找。
When a partition scheme is genuinely needed, a partition index is the right answer, speeding the catalog lookup without changing the layout at all.

8515
13:58:19,438 --> 13:58:22,276
只要变动一个条款，更好的答案就会变。
One changed clause and the better answer moves.

8516
13:58:22,702 --> 13:58:25,060
这值得专门练习一下。
That is worth practicing deliberately.

8517
13:58:26,574 --> 13:58:28,096
第 13 题，共 20 题。
Question 13 of 20.

8518
13:58:28,336 --> 13:58:29,156
领域 3。
Domain 3.

8519
13:58:29,902 --> 13:58:36,068
当应用程序丢弃一个格式错误的记录时，会写入一条包含 text record underscore rejected 文字的日志行。
An application writes a log line containing the text record underscore rejected whenever it discards a malformed record.

8520
13:58:36,686 --> 13:58:38,692
这些行进入 CloudWatch 日志。
These lines go to CloudWatch logs.

8521
13:58:39,086 --> 13:58:43,140
运营部门希望在拒绝率超过阈值时收到通知。
Operations want to be notified when the rate of rejections exceeds the threshold.

8522
13:58:43,696 --> 13:58:48,612
他们尝试过，但无法直接针对日志组配置 CloudWatch 警报。
They have tried and failed to configure a CloudWatch alarm directly against the log group.

8523
13:58:49,376 --> 13:58:51,684
数据工程师应该执行什么操作？
What should the data engineer implement?

8524
13:58:53,646 --> 13:59:00,068
a 使用匹配该模式的 CloudWatch 日志指标过滤器，并在生成的指标上设置警报。
a A CloudWatch logs metric filter matching the pattern with an alarm on the resulting metric.

8525
13:59:01,070 --> 13:59:01,376
b
b

8526
13:59:02,542 --> 13:59:06,820
配置以日志组作为其指标源的 CloudWatch 警报。
A CloudWatch alarm configured with the log group as its metric source.

8527
13:59:09,166 --> 13:59:14,820
c 使用 CloudWatch 日志订阅过滤器将匹配的事件传输到 Amazon S3。
A CloudWatch logs subscription filter delivering matching events to Amazon S3.

8528
13:59:16,206 --> 13:59:19,428
d 使用匹配日志内容的 EventBridge 规则。
d An event bridge rule matching the log content.

8529
13:59:20,558 --> 13:59:21,828
暂停并做出决定。
Pause and decide.

8530
13:59:31,424 --> 13:59:32,704
答案是 A。
The answer is A.

8531
13:59:33,184 --> 13:59:42,340
提到他们尝试过但无法在日志组上设置警报的句子是有意为之的。这是因为这告诉你选项 B 描述的是不存在的功能。
The sentence saying they tried and failed to alarm on a log group is doing deliberate work. That is because it tells you option. B describe something that does not exist.

8532
13:59:42,958 --> 13:59:49,828
CloudWatch 警报是评估指标而非日志内容，因此无法直接针对包含特定词汇的日志行发出警报。
CloudWatch alarms evaluate metrics rather than log content, so there is no way to alarm directly on a log line containing a particular word.

8533
13:59:50,464 --> 13:59:56,864
指标过滤器填补了这一空白，它匹配传入事件中的模式并发布计数这些事件的指标。
A metric filter closes that gap, matching a pattern in incoming events and publishing a metric counting them.

8534
13:59:57,422 --> 14:00:01,092
警报随后会像监控任何其他指标一样监控该指标。
The alarm then watches that metric exactly like any other.

8535
14:00:01,518 --> 14:00:08,132
这是一个两步走的答案，而只提供其中一个步骤的选项是不完整的，而不是错误的。
It is a two-step answer, and an option offering only one of those two steps is incomplete rather than wrong.

8536
14:00:09,870 --> 14:00:11,684
第 14 题，共 20 题。
Question 14 of 20.

8537
14:00:14,574 --> 14:00:15,556
领域 3。
Domain 3.

8538
14:00:15,984 --> 14:00:23,492
一个基于 Amazon Redshift 构建的执行仪表板，每天早上 8 点到 9 点约有 800 人访问。
An executive dashboard built on Amazon Redshift is opened by around 800 people between 8 and 9 each morning.

8539
14:00:23,744 --> 14:00:28,164
底层数据在夜间更新一次，且在白天不会改变。
The underlying data is refreshed once overnight and does not change during the day.

8540
14:00:28,878 --> 14:00:33,348
在那一个小时内，集群上的其他分析工作负载明显变慢。
During that hour, other analytical workloads on the cluster slow noticeably.

8541
14:00:33,902 --> 14:00:36,740
每个查看者的仪表板运行的都是同一组查询。
Every viewer's dashboard runs the same set of queries.

8542
14:00:37,262 --> 14:00:38,948
最合适的更改是什么？
What is the most appropriate change?

8543
14:00:40,782 --> 14:00:47,184
a 将仪表板数据集导入 SPICE，并在夜间加载完成后进行刷新。
Import the dashboard dataset into SPICE and refresh it after the overnight load completes.

8544
14:00:49,070 --> 14:00:54,464
b 启用 Redshift 并发扩展，让额外的集群吸收早晨的突发流量。
Enable redshift concurrency scaling so additional clusters absorb the morning burst.

8545
14:00:54,784 --> 14:00:58,436
c 调整 Redshift 集群的大小以处理峰值需求。
C. Resize the redshift cluster to handle the peak.

8546
14:00:58,784 --> 14:00:59,104
d
D.

8547
14:00:59,344 --> 14:01:03,744
将仪表板指向 Amazon S3 中相同数据的 Amazon Athena。
Point the dashboard at Amazon Athena over the same data in Amazon S3.

8548
14:01:04,270 --> 14:01:05,316
暂停并做出决定。
Pause and decide.

8549
14:01:19,790 --> 14:01:26,276
并发扩展非常适合那些确实需要运行的突发查询，模块 10 也提到了这一点。
Concurrency scaling is exactly right for a burst of queries that genuinely need running, and module 10 said so.

8550
14:01:27,214 --> 14:01:35,780
但在这种情况下，它们不需要动态执行，因为有 800 人在询问关于同一份且自夜间加载以来未变动的数据。
Here they do not need running because 800 people are asking an identical question of data that has not changed since the overnight load.

8551
14:01:36,494 --> 14:01:43,424
SPICE 从一个缓存副本中提供所有答案，且永远不会触及数据仓库。
S P I C E answers all of them from one cached copy and the warehouse is never touched.

8552
14:01:43,744 --> 14:01:47,460
这个原则是第 13 模块一直在强调的。
The principle is the one module 13 kept returning to.

8553
14:02:12,704 --> 14:02:20,228
在这种用例下，部分数据比没有数据更糟糕，因为基于不完整数据生成的报告已经提交过两次了。
Partial figures are worse than no figures for this use case because reports built on incomplete data have twice been filed.

8554
14:02:20,704 --> 14:02:25,252
团队想要缓存这些内容，并且不想编写自定义的校验代码。
The team wants to cache this and does not want to write custom validation code.

8555
14:02:26,542 --> 14:02:29,668
选择数据工程师应该采取的两个操作。
Select two actions the data engineer should take.

8556
14:02:32,014 --> 14:02:38,944
A. 在 ETL 作业中添加 AWS Glue 数据质量规则，检查货币列的完整性。
Add AWS Glue data quality rules inside the ETL job checking completeness of the currency column.

8557
14:02:39,310 --> 14:02:50,532
B. 配置作业在规则集不通过时失败，这样就不会加载下游内容。C. 配置作业将失败的记录路由到隔离区并继续运行。
B. Configure the job to faint when the rule set does not pass so nothing downstream is loaded. C. Configure the job to route failing records to a quarantine location and continue.

8558
14:02:51,086 --> 14:02:51,344
D。
D.

8559
14:02:52,366 --> 14:02:55,780
在 Glue 作业的失败运行次数上添加 CloudWatch 警报。
Add a cloud watch alarm on the blue job's failed run count.

8560
14:02:56,430 --> 14:02:57,604
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

8561
14:03:07,246 --> 14:03:09,412
答案是 A 和 B。
The answers are A and B.

8562
14:03:10,000 --> 14:03:16,708
选项 B 和 C 是指向相反方向的相同决策，而场景中的一句话在两者之间做了选择。
Options B and C are the same decision pointing in opposite directions, and one sentence in the scenario chooses between them.

8563
14:03:17,838 --> 14:03:22,052
“部分数据比没有数据更糟糕”意味着停止流水线是正确的做法。
Partial figures being worse than no figures means stopping the pipeline is correct.

8564
14:03:22,702 --> 14:03:30,404
因为如果使用隔离区，剩下的 99% 数据仍会加载，并产生他们已经提交过两次的那个不完整报告。
That is because a quarantine would let the remaining 99% load and produce exactly the incomplete report they have already filed twice.

8565
14:03:30,880 --> 14:03:37,988
对于另一个合格记录本身就有价值的用例，C 是正确的，而 B 则过于谨慎。
For a different use case where good records have value on their own, C would be right and B would be overcautious.

8566
14:03:38,798 --> 14:03:45,636
也就是说，第 15 模块关于“反对隔离”的决策以及业务背景是每次筛选选项的关键。
That is, module 15's fail against quarantine decision and the business context is what sections it every time.

8567
14:03:47,310 --> 14:03:49,060
第 16 题，共 20 题。
Question 16 of 20.

8568
14:03:49,440 --> 14:03:50,372
领域 3。
Domain 3.

8569
14:03:50,862 --> 14:04:00,740
一名分析师在 Amazon Athena 中意外对一个 40 TB 的未分区表执行了 select star 查询，导致单次查询产生数百美元的费用。
An analyst accidentally ran a select star query against a 40-terabyte unpartitioned table in Amazon Athena, producing a single query costing several hundred dollars.

8570
14:04:02,382 --> 14:04:04,740
管理层希望防止此类情况再次发生。
Management wants to prevent a recurrence.

8571
14:04:05,454 --> 14:04:09,476
底层数据计划在下个季度转换为分区 Parquet。
The underlying data is scheduled to be converted to partition paquet next quarter.

8572
14:04:09,934 --> 14:04:12,100
数据工程师现在应该配置什么？
What should the data engineer configure now?

8573
14:04:12,560 --> 14:04:15,492
A. 移除分析师的 Athena 权限。
a remove the analyst's Athena permissions.

8574
14:04:15,950 --> 14:04:19,492
B. 在 Athena 服务上设置 AWS 预算警报。
B. An AWS budget alert on the Athena service.

8575
14:04:19,840 --> 14:04:23,652
C. 在 Athena 工作组上设置单次查询的数据扫描限制。
C. A per query data scan limit on the Athena work group.

8576
14:04:24,302 --> 14:04:24,560
D。
D.

8577
14:04:25,550 --> 14:04:29,988
增加工作组的查询超时时间，以降低大查询被重试的可能性。
Increase the workgroup's query timeout so large queries are less likely to be retried.

8578
14:04:30,400 --> 14:04:31,460
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

8579
14:04:41,070 --> 14:04:47,044
答案是 A，区别在于第 19 模块中提到的“预防”与“检测”的区别。
The answer is A and the distinction is the prevent against detect split from module 19.

8580
14:04:47,600 --> 14:04:50,468
单次查询扫描限制是一种真正的控制手段。
A per query scan limit is a genuine control.

8581
14:04:50,960 --> 14:04:58,180
这是因为 Athena 一旦检测到查询将超过设定的数据量就会取消该查询，所以最坏的情况是被限制住了而不是被报告出来。
That is because Athena cancels the query once it would exceed the stated volume, so the worst case is bounded rather than reported.

8582
14:04:59,086 --> 14:05:07,044
预算警报是在钱花掉之后才进行的检测。两者各有用途，而题目问的是如何防止再次发生。
A budget alert is detection arriving after the money is spent. Both have their place and the question asks how to prevent a recurrence.

8583
14:05:07,694 --> 14:05:11,236
还要注意，扫描限制是一种护栏，而不是一种修复手段。
Note also that the scan limit is a guardrail rather than a fix.

8584
14:05:12,046 --> 14:05:18,564
这就是为什么最后一句提到下个季度转换为分区 Parquet 是真正的解决办法。
That is why the last sentence mentions the conversion to partition parquet next quarter as the real remedy.

8585
14:05:20,238 --> 14:05:22,052
第 17 题，共 20 题。
Question 17 of 20.

8586
14:05:22,574 --> 14:05:23,428
领域 4。
Domain 4.

8587
14:05:24,430 --> 14:05:28,772
一家公司拥有 15 个 AWS 账号和大约 60 名工程师。
A company has 15 AWS accounts and around 60 engineers.

8588
14:05:29,614 --> 14:05:34,468
每位工程师在他们工作的每个账户中都有一个带有访问密钥的 IAM 用户。
Each engineer has an IAM user with access keys in every account they work in.

8589
14:05:35,726 --> 14:05:40,964
上个季度有两个人离职，安全团队无法确认所有他们的凭证都已移除。
Two people left last quarter and the security team cannot confirm all their credentials were removed.

8590
14:05:41,870 --> 14:05:48,516
公司希望在雇佣结束时终止访问权限，并停止发放长期有效的密钥。
The company wants access to end when employment ends and to stop issuing long-lived keys.

8591
14:05:49,262 --> 14:05:51,200
公司应该实施什么？
What should the company implement?

8592
14:05:52,560 --> 14:05:58,532
A. 一个删除闲置 60 天的 IAM 用户的计划 Lambda 函数。
A scheduled lambda function deleting IAM users inactive for 60 days.

8593
14:05:59,054 --> 14:06:04,708
B. 在所有账户中强制执行 90 天更换一次访问密钥的策略。
B A 90-day access key rotation policy enforced across all accounts.

8594
14:06:07,022 --> 14:06:15,428
C. 将 AWS IAM Identity Center 与公司目录进行联合身份验证，并使用授予各账户角色的权限集。
AWS IA M Identity Center federated to the corporate directory with permission sets granting roles per account.

8595
14:06:15,920 --> 14:06:19,076
D. 将 15 个账户合并为 3 个。
D. Consolidate the 15 accounts into three.

8596
14:06:20,430 --> 14:06:21,668
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

8597
14:06:31,374 --> 14:06:32,740
答案是 A。
The answer is A.

8598
14:06:33,742 --> 14:06:38,660
决定这一题的条款是：访问权限应在雇佣结束时终止。
The clause that decides it is that access should end when employment ends.

8599
14:06:39,040 --> 14:06:44,100
这是一个关于身份存储位置的陈述，而不是关于如何管理凭证的陈述。
That is a statement about where identity lives rather than about how credentials are managed.

8600
14:06:45,006 --> 14:06:53,380
只有联合身份验证符合要求，因为访问权限源自目录账户，而不是分布在各个账户中的 15 个独立副本。
Only Federation satisfies it because access follows from the directory account rather than from 15 independent copies scattered across accounts.

8601
14:06:54,062 --> 14:06:59,972
选项 B 虽然是真正的安全改进，但并不符合题目要求的任何一项。
Option B deserves respect as a genuine security improvement that answers neither stated requirement.

8602
14:07:00,878 --> 14:07:05,284
每 90 天更换一次密钥可以缩短泄露后可利用的时间窗口。
Rotating a key every 90 days shortens the window, a leak is useful for.

8603
14:07:06,062 --> 14:07:10,852
但它仍然让长期有效的凭证一直存在，而这正是公司想要停止的。
It keeps a long lived credential in existence throughout, which is the thing the company said.

8604
14:07:11,246 --> 14:07:13,028
公司想停止发放这些密钥。
It wants to stop issuing.

8605
14:07:14,670 --> 14:07:16,240
第 18 题，共 20 题。
Question 18 of 20.

8606
14:07:16,622 --> 14:07:17,508
领域 4。
Domain 4.

8607
14:07:17,934 --> 14:07:21,600
一家保险公司在 Amazon Redshift 中存储索赔数据。
An insurer holds claims data in Amazon Redshift.

8608
14:07:22,126 --> 14:07:25,508
区域团队只能看到他们所在区域的索赔信息。
Regional teams must see only their own regions' claims.

8609
14:07:25,998 --> 14:07:28,100
反欺诈团队必须能看到所有区域的数据。
A fraud team must see all regions.

8610
14:07:28,942 --> 14:07:36,388
支持团队必须看到所有区域，但在显示索赔人的国家识别码时需进行部分遮盖，而反欺诈团队可以看到完整信息。
A support team must see all regions, but with the claimant's national identifier partially masked while the fraud team sees it in full.

8611
14:07:37,422 --> 14:07:44,196
目前有 11 个视图在维护这些组合，而且要让它们与架构变更保持一致变得非常麻烦。
There are currently 11 views maintaining these combinations and keeping them aligned with schema changes has become a burden.

8612
14:07:45,040 --> 14:07:47,332
数据工程师应该采用什么方案？
What should the data engineer implement?

8613
14:07:47,790 --> 14:07:52,960
A. 为每个区域创建一个表，并在需要的地方去掉标识符列。
a create one table per region with the identifier column omitted where required.

8614
14:07:53,280 --> 14:07:58,201
B. 继续使用视图，在架构变更时自动生成它们。
B. Continue with views, generating them automatically when the schema changes.

8615
14:07:58,350 --> 14:08:04,068
C. 将数据迁移到 Amazon S3 并应用 Lake Formation 数据过滤。
c. Move the data to Amazon S3 and apply lake formation data filters.

8616
14:08:04,942 --> 14:08:05,200
D。
D.

8617
14:08:06,126 --> 14:08:12,996
针对区域过滤的行级安全策略，以及根据角色对标识符列进行动态数据脱敏。
Role level security policies for the regional filtering and dynamic data masking on the identifier column by role.

8618
14:08:13,614 --> 14:08:14,692
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

8619
14:08:24,174 --> 14:08:25,600
答案是 A。
The answer is A.

8620
14:08:25,920 --> 14:08:32,640
这个场景描述了两个截然不同的需求，而这两个需求恰好对应 Redshift 的两种不同的原生功能。
The scenario describes two genuinely different requirements that happen to have two different native redshift features.

8621
14:08:33,198 --> 14:08:40,036
区域过滤属于行级安全，即附加到表上的策略会根据会话身份来过滤行。
Regional filtering is row level security where a policy attached to the table filters rows according to the session's identity.

8622
14:08:40,942 --> 14:08:45,120
这样每个团队查询同一个表时，都能看到属于自己区域的数据。
So every team queries the same table and sees its own region.

8623
14:08:45,518 --> 14:08:53,572
脱敏需求则是动态数据脱敏，即同一个列会根据请求者的角色返回部分或全部数值。
The masking requirement is dynamic data masking where the same column returns a partial or a full value depending on the role asking.

8624
14:08:54,350 --> 14:08:58,308
选项 C 值得注意，因为它完全偏离了方向。
Option C is worth noting because it is the wrong direction entirely.

8625
14:08:59,150 --> 14:09:04,932
它把数据从数据仓库移出，去追求一个数据仓库本身就具备的特性。
It moves data out of the warehouse to reach a capability the warehouse already has natively.

8626
14:09:06,222 --> 14:09:07,940
第 19 题，共 20 题。
Question 19 of 20.

8627
14:09:08,400 --> 14:09:09,540
领域 4。
Domain 4.

8628
14:09:11,086 --> 14:09:19,588
一个包含约 5000 万个 Parquet 对象的数据湖，使用客户托管密钥通过 SSE-KMS 进行加密。
A data lake of around 50 million parket objects is encrypted with SSEKMS using a customer managed key.

8629
14:09:20,078 --> 14:09:25,732
合规性要求必须有审计追踪的客户托管密钥，因此不能更改加密方式。
Compliance requires a customer managed key with an audit trail, so the encryption cannot be changed.

8630
14:09:26,254 --> 14:09:34,084
财务部门指出，AWS KMS 的账单是按查询量计算的，而不是按存储数据量计算。
Finance has flagged that the AWS KMS bill scales with query volume rather than with the amount of data stored.

8631
14:09:34,480 --> 14:09:36,452
数据工程师该怎么做？
What should the data engineer do?

8632
14:09:37,006 --> 14:09:40,960
A. 将数据迁移到 S3 Standard-低频访问。
a move the data to S3 standard infrequent access.

8633
14:09:41,280 --> 14:09:43,588
B. 将存储桶切换为 SSE
B switch the bucket to SS

8634
14:09:44,238 --> 14:09:45,988
S3 加密。
E S3 encryption.

8635
14:09:46,960 --> 14:09:47,280
C
C

8636
14:09:48,238 --> 14:09:52,068
请求增加 KMS 请求配额。
request a KMS request quota increase.

8637
14:09:53,120 --> 14:09:53,280
D
D

8638
14:09:54,862 --> 14:09:57,636
在存储桶上启用 S3 存储桶密钥。
enable S3 bucket keys on the bucket.

8639
14:09:58,800 --> 14:10:00,196
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

8640
14:10:09,943 --> 14:10:10,820
答案是
The answer is

8641
14:10:11,103 --> 14:10:12,563
A。
A.

8642
14:10:12,880 --> 14:10:18,852
诊断性短语是：账单是根据查询量而非存储量来计算的。
The diagnostic phrase is that the bill scales with query volume rather than stored volume.

8643
14:10:19,822 --> 14:10:24,663
这意味着你是在为每次解密请求付费，而不是为静态数据付费。
That means you are paying per decryption request rather than for the data at rest.

8644
14:10:25,710 --> 14:10:30,084
如果没有桶密钥，读取每个对象都会触发一次对 KMS 的调用。
Without bucket keys, every object read triggers a call to KMS.

8645
14:10:30,400 --> 14:10:34,916
因此，一个打开 5000 万个对象的任务会产生 5000 万次计费请求。
So a job opening 50 million objects makes 50 million billable requests.

8646
14:10:35,760 --> 14:10:41,924
桶密钥改变了机制，使用一个短寿命的桶级密钥在本地派生每个对象的密钥。
Bucket keys change the mechanism using a short-lived bucket level key to derive per object keys locally.

8647
14:10:42,702 --> 14:10:48,132
在相同的客户管理密钥和相同的加密下，KMS 调用会大幅减少。
KMS calls FALL dramatically with the same customer managed key and the same encryption.

8648
14:10:49,646 --> 14:10:55,876
选项 B 是原则上应该排除的，因为它通过移除所需的合规控制来解决成本问题。
Option B is the shape to reject on principle, solving a cost problem by removing the control compliance required.

8649
14:10:57,422 --> 14:10:58,724
第 20 题，共 20 题。
Question 20 of 20.

8650
14:10:59,022 --> 14:10:59,876
领域 4。
Domain 4.

8651
14:11:00,558 --> 14:11:05,316
一个大型机构在六个业务单元中拥有大约 800 个数据集。
A large organization has around 800 datasets across six business units.

8652
14:11:05,920 --> 14:11:12,836
访问请求由中央平台团队处理，他们每周收到约 40 个请求，每个请求处理需要几天时间。
Access requests are handled by a central platform team who receive around 40 a week and take several days each.

8653
14:11:13,680 --> 14:11:18,948
审批请求的团队往往不知道申请者是否应该拥有这些数据。
The team approving requests often does not know whether the requester should have the data.

8654
14:11:19,854 --> 14:11:26,404
该机构希望由数据所有者来决定请求，并记录每项决策以供审计。
The organization wants requests decided by whoever owns the data with each decision recorded for audit.

8655
14:11:27,854 --> 14:11:30,148
数据工程师应该实施什么？
What should the data engineer implement?

8656
14:11:32,590 --> 14:11:38,404
A. 为每个业务单位在其自己的数据库上授予 Lake Formation 数据库级权限。
Grant each business unit database level lake formation permissions on its own databases.

8657
14:11:39,022 --> 14:11:42,244
b 将数据集作为资产发布在 Amazon 中。
b Publish datasets as assets in Amazon.

8658
14:11:42,640 --> 14:11:48,260
使用 SageMaker Catalog，并采用由数据所有者审批请求的订阅工作流。
SageMaker catalog and use the subscription workflow with data owners approving requests.

8659
14:11:48,974 --> 14:11:49,200
C。
C.

8660
14:11:50,158 --> 14:11:52,804
在中央平台团队中增加更多工程师。
Add more engineers to the central platform team.

8661
14:11:53,440 --> 14:11:53,680
D。
D.

8662
14:11:54,926 --> 14:12:02,084
给每个分析师提供所有 800 个数据集的读取权限，并使用 CloudRail 审计使用情况。
Give every analyst read access to all 800 datasets and audit usage with CloudRail.

8663
14:12:02,958 --> 14:12:04,228
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

8664
14:12:13,966 --> 14:12:19,600
答案是 A，题目提出了两个只有一个选项能同时满足的要求。
The answer is A, and the question states two requirements that only one option satisfies together.

8665
14:12:19,840 --> 14:12:28,004
决策应由数据所有者做出，这解决了中心团队缺乏背景的问题，且每项决策必须记录下来以供审计。
Decisions should be made by whoever owns the data, which addresses the central team's lack of context and each decision must be recorded for audit.

8666
14:12:28,814 --> 14:12:30,692
订阅工作流同时满足这两个要求。
The subscription workflow does both.

8667
14:12:31,054 --> 14:12:38,468
因为用户带着明确的目的请求访问，所有者进行批准或拒绝，该决定会记录在资产上。
Because a consumer requests access with a stated purpose, the owner approves or refuses, the decision is captured against the asset.

8668
14:12:39,086 --> 14:12:41,924
底层的 Lake Formation 授权会自动应用。
The underlying lake formation grant is applied automatically.

8669
14:12:42,798 --> 14:12:52,708
选项 C 是值得特别提到的，因为增加排队人数是组织通常采取的反应。它只是扩大了瓶颈，而不是消除瓶颈。
Option C is the one worth naming because adding people to a queue is the response organizations actually reach for. It scales the bottleneck rather than removing it.

8670
14:12:54,160 --> 14:13:00,080
有了三组结果，这种映射比之前只有一组时要有用得多。
With three sets of results, this mapping becomes considerably more useful than it was after one.

8671
14:13:00,480 --> 14:13:02,404
漏掉一题的错误只是干扰项。
A row missed once is noise.

8672
14:13:02,894 --> 14:13:11,044
如果在 60 道题中连续错两题，那就是明显的知识盲区，剩下的备考时间应该花在对应的模块上。
A row missed twice across 60 questions is a genuine gap, and the module named is where the remaining preparation time should go.

8673
14:13:11,950 --> 14:13:14,800
在考试 1 中错过但在考试 2 和 3 中通过的题目，
A row missed in exam 1 and passed in exams.

8674
14:13:14,960 --> 14:13:17,444
证明了复习起到了作用。
2 and 3 is evidence that reviewing worked.

8675
14:13:17,920 --> 14:13:20,132
这本身就值得关注。
That is worth knowing for its own sake.

8676
14:13:20,814 --> 14:13:24,996
它告诉你这个方法是有效的，你只需要把它应用到剩下的内容上。
It tells you the method is sound and you simply need to apply it to whatever is left.

8677
14:13:26,640 --> 14:13:31,236
这种发现是从 60 道题中值得提取的重点，而不是从 20 道题里找。
The callout is the finding worth taking from 60 questions rather than 20.

8678
14:13:31,840 --> 14:13:35,364
在所有三组题目中，有一种构造方式占据了主导地位。
Across all three sets, one construction dominated.

8679
14:13:35,760 --> 14:13:41,220
这种选项虽然解决了技术问题，但却破坏了场景中明确禁止的内容。
An option that solved a technical problem while breaking something the scenario had explicitly refused.

8680
14:13:42,126 --> 14:13:47,268
没有新代码、没有源码更改、没有操作能力，就无法改变协议。
No new code, no source changes, no capacity to operate cannot change the protocol.

8681
14:13:48,142 --> 14:13:52,644
这就是为什么第 22 模块要求在阅读选项之前先找出约束条件。
That is why module 22 put finding the constraint before reading the options.

8682
14:13:53,550 --> 14:14:02,884
这也是为什么本课程中几乎每个解题提示都指向场景中的句子，而不是选项本身。
Why the signal call out on almost every solution in this course points at a sentence in the scenario rather than at anything in the options themselves.

8683
14:14:04,622 --> 14:14:08,484
这是一个小的诊断工具，偶尔能提供有用的信息。
This is a small diagnostic and it occasionally reveals something useful.

8684
14:14:10,542 --> 14:14:17,604
这三场考试的正确答案在 A、B、C、D 四个字母上的分布大致均匀，这是刻意修正的结果。
The correct answers in these three exams are distributed roughly evenly across the four letters, which was a deliberate correction.

8685
14:14:18,560 --> 14:14:24,964
这是因为考试 1 的初稿中，22 个正确答案里有 21 个是 A 或 B。
That is because the first draft of exam 1 put 21 of its 22 correct marks on A or B.

8686
14:14:25,280 --> 14:14:31,652
如果你在 60 道题中的选择高度集中在某一个字母上，那并不是题目造成的。
If your own choices cluster heavily on one letter across 60 questions, the questions are not causing that.

8687
14:14:32,494 --> 14:14:37,572
最常见的解释是：你选了一个读起来顺眼的选项，然后略过了其他的。
The most common explanation is settling on an option that reads well and skimming the rest.

8688
14:14:38,222 --> 14:14:41,604
这也是一种让你容易被更好的选项误导的习惯。
That is also the habit that makes you vulnerable to a better option.

8689
14:14:42,254 --> 14:14:43,524
处于这种状态。
Sitting in position.

8690
14:14:44,160 --> 14:14:44,480
B。
B.

8691
14:14:46,382 --> 14:14:50,560
第二个要点是最常见的情况，我们必须诚实面对这一点。
The second bullet is the most common outcome and it is worth being honest about.

8692
14:14:50,990 --> 14:14:55,460
如果你的三次得分非常接近，最可能的解释并不是你遇到了瓶颈。
If your three scores are similar, the likeliest explanation is not that you have plateaued.

8693
14:14:55,950 --> 14:14:59,364
而是因为你连续做了三次测试，却没有去学习前两次考试的结果。
It is that you took three tests without studying the results of the first two.

8694
14:15:00,110 --> 14:15:03,652
第四个要点描述了大多数考生的真实情况。
The fourth bullet describes the shape most candidates have.

8695
14:15:04,014 --> 14:15:08,548
这是因为领域 1 占考试的三分之一，并占据了大部分的复习时间。
That is because domain 1 is a third of the exam and gets most of the study time.

8696
14:15:09,198 --> 14:15:12,772
与此同时，领域 4 只占 18%，却经常被忽视。
Meanwhile, domain 4 is 18% and gets neglected.

8697
14:15:13,422 --> 14:15:18,084
模块 0 在课程开始时就提到了这个观察结果，我们也应该以此作为结尾。
Module 0 opened this course with that observation and it is worth closing on it.

8698
14:15:19,022 --> 14:15:24,196
这是因为对于大多数人来说，通过 9 道得分题是成本最低的提升方式。
That is because 9 score questions is the cheapest improvement available to most people.

8699
14:15:25,710 --> 14:15:27,840
第三个要点才是最重要的。
The third bullet is the one that matters most.

8700
14:15:28,000 --> 14:15:33,380
这就是为什么本课程中的每一个解答幻灯片都在解释全部四个选项，而不仅仅是正确的那个。
It is why every solution slide in this course explains all four options rather than only the correct one.

8701
14:15:34,126 --> 14:15:37,092
能认出正确答案是一回事。
Being able to recognize the right answer is one thing.

8702
14:15:37,582 --> 14:15:44,932
但要能说出另外三个选项为什么不对，才能应对那些措辞不同但考查相同决策的题目。
Being able to say why the other three fail is what survives a differently worded question about the same decision.

8703
14:15:45,582 --> 14:15:53,348
如果你能搞定 60 道题并指出每个干扰项的缺陷，你就掌握了决策逻辑，而不仅仅是答案。
If you can work through 60 questions and articulate the flaw in every distractor, you understand the decisions rather than the answers.

8704
14:15:54,030 --> 14:15:56,612
这才是考试真正考查的内容。
That is what this exam is actually testing.

8705
14:15:58,350 --> 14:15:59,972
这也是这门课程的核心目的。
That is the whole course.

8706
14:16:00,560 --> 14:16:08,388
20 个教学模块涵盖了全部四个领域，以及 2025 年 12 月考试指南中的每一个任务陈述。
20 teaching modules covered all four domains and every task statement in the December 2025 exam guide.

8707
14:16:08,942 --> 14:16:14,960
从第 1 模块的思维模型一直到第 20 模块的治理。
From the mental model in module 1 through to governance in module 20.

8708
14:16:15,534 --> 14:16:24,452
还有易混淆项、考试的出题方式、新旧教材之间的知识差距，以及三套模拟考试。
Then confusion pairs, how the exam writes its questions, the revision gap between this exam and older material, and three practice exams.

8709
14:16:25,038 --> 14:16:31,588
总共包含约 100 个案例场景，每个场景都会指出决定答案的关键句，并给出每个选项的理由。
About 100 word scenarios in total, each one naming the sentence that decided it and giving a reason for every option.

8710
14:16:32,334 --> 14:16:40,292
如果某个服务的讲解感觉不够深入，那通常是刻意为之，因为专门涵盖该内容的模块在当时已经明确说明过了。
If a service felt thin somewhere, that was usually deliberate because the module that covers it properly said so at the time.

8711
14:16:42,000 --> 14:16:48,560
最后一点值得重申，因为背后的数据决定了这门课程的架构。
The last bullet is worth restating because the numbers behind it were the reason this course is shaped as it is.

8712
14:16:48,880 --> 14:16:54,308
在分析的资料中，安全和治理相关的术语占比不足 5%。
Security and governance terms accounted for under 5% of mentions in the material analyzed.

8713
14:16:54,862 --> 14:16:59,460
第四个领域占考试的 18%，大约相当于 9 分的题目。
Domain 4 is 18% of the exam, which is roughly 9 score questions.

8714
14:16:59,854 --> 14:17:04,260
这个差距是几乎所有考生都能轻松拿分的提分点。
That gap is the single cheapest improvement available to almost anybody preparing.

8715
14:17:05,294 --> 14:17:07,844
第四点也是一个刻意的选择。
The fourth bullet was a deliberate choice, too.

8716
14:17:08,558 --> 14:17:18,820
因为如果课程只教考试答案，你可能会自信地推荐一个在 18 个月前就停止面向新客户服务的服务。
That is because a course that teaches only the exam answer leaves you confidently recommending a service that closed to new customers 18 months ago.

8717
14:17:19,822 --> 14:17:21,188
祝你考试顺利。
Good luck with the exam.

